* Exact initial-access technique
* Whether voice phishing was actually the initial compromise mechanism
* Whether an ADT employee identity was compromised
* Which identity provider was involved
* Whether credentials were stolen
* Whether MFA was configured
* Whether MFA enrollment or recovery was manipulated
* Whether an attacker-controlled MFA method was registered
* Whether session tokens were stolen
* Whether OAuth or application authorization was involved
* Whether privilege escalation occurred
* Exact cloud service or application affected
* Exact permissions available to the compromised identity
* Exact duration of unauthorized access
* Attacker dwell time
* Exact exfiltration method
* Whether bulk export functionality was used
* Whether APIs were used to extract customer information
* Definitive number of unique affected individuals
* Exact number of records containing dates of birth
* Exact number containing partial SSNs
* Exact number containing partial Tax IDs
* How long affected customer and prospect information had been retained
